                "text": "$\\dfrac{6}{\\sqrt{3}} = 2\\sqrt{3}$; $\\dfrac{1}{3+\\sqrt{2}} = \\dfrac{3-\\sqrt{2}}{7}$"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
