    "body": "Surds live on Paper 1, the non-calculator paper, and the instruction is usually \"simplify fully\" or \"rationalise the denominator\". The exact form is the answer; a decimal scores nothing. Two or three marks each, and they turn up inside Pythagoras, area, and trigonometry questions at the top end.",
